src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7ee6820b93831d948fe6b3c77238ade77f7ceb44.gif\" alt=\"Mount\"></p>\n<p><strong>更具細節的容器貼圖</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3c667af4576f0d38850f84789315a6e96d2bcc5.gif\" alt=\"Containers\"></p>",
